}

body:json {
  {
    "inviteCode": "ABC12345"
  }
}

docs {
  # Join Household
  
  Allows an authenticated user to join a household using an invite code.
  
  ## Authentication
  Requires a valid JWT token in the Authorization header (Bearer token).
  
  ## Request Body
  - `inviteCode` (required): 8-character invite code
  
  ## Response Fields
  - `id` (guid): Household identifier
  - `name` (string): Household name
  - `timeZoneId` (string): IANA timezone identifier
  - `members` (array): List of household members
  
  ## Behavior
  - The invite code is invalidated after successful use
  - User is added as a regular member (not admin)
  
  ## Error Responses
  - `400 Bad Request`: Invalid invite code format (must be 8 characters)
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Invalid or missing authentication token
  - `404 Not Found`: Invite code not found or expired
  - `409 Conflict`: User already belongs to a household
}
